# Week 4 Stakeholder Register

## Stakeholder Identification

A stakeholder does not have to work on the project every day to influence it because they may have authority, knowledge, or an interest in the project's outcome. For example, the RCHN Board of Directors may not be involved in the daily project work, but they can influence major decisions, provide support, or affect whether the project moves forward. Their approval and expectations can impact the project even if they are not part of the project team.

